	(text "01 Output stage: 4 octal sockets (solder side, as built; standard octal numbering), per-tube 220n coupling cap and 91k grid leak to its own bias (BIASn, sheet 03), 5.6k grid stopper, 1k 5 W flameproof screen resistor from V_SCREEN, 1 ohm cathode shunt with a power diode and a Kelvin tap (KELVn) to the ADC (sheet 03)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 10.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aacb48d8-390e-599e-8fc8-525ee3b38f30")
	)
	(text "Coupling cap 220 nF / 630 V film and grid leak 91k for all four types (decided 2026-11-23, V1 / V2): grid circuit 91k + 5.6k + 1k = 98 kOhm. 6550 DEVIATION: twice its 50 kOhm fixed-bias rating (Tung-Sol), accepted; covered by the cold-default bias and the FPGA's per-tube current loop and over-current cut-off (rev C). Within rating for 6L6GC / KT88 (100k) and EL34 (500k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "20f35b2c-7bdd-52a7-8859-7be218abf4d1")
	)
	(text "Ground: GND = AGND, the local star at the GND_PWR tab (J101 pin 2). The cathode shunts, the drive grounds (W24, solid at this end), the HV decoupling and the bias circuit return here. Heaters float: no heater reference on this board (interfaces.md 5). OT secondary COM is not connected here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2bc4a24c-a671-5465-a5bc-29d9167dca88")
	)
