	(text "Open-load protection, FITTED (docs/output_stage_stability.md): one 2 kV diode from GND to each plate (no series string, so no sharing resistors); 2x P6KE350CA in series from each plate to the centre tap (V_ANODE): 664-736 V string, off with a load at full overdrive, plates held at about 1.1-1.2 kV when the speaker is pulled. OT_A / OT_B / CL_x reach 1.25 kV to GND: >= 6.3 mm creepage and clearance (slots)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 83.82 167.64 0)
		(effects
